abstract: >
  GBS-Sentinel is an open-source Nextflow DSL2 workflow for genomic
  surveillance of Streptococcus agalactiae (Group B Streptococcus).
  The workflow accepts paired-end sequencing reads or pre-assembled
  genomes and integrates genome quality assessment, assembly,
  functional annotation, MLST, capsular serotyping, antimicrobial
  resistance detection, virulence profiling, core-genome analysis,
  phylogenetic analysis, and integrated surveillance reporting.
